---
title: Novel Inorganic Materials Lab opens at NTU
titleZhHant: 新穎無機材料實驗室於臺大成立
date: 2025-08-01
summary:
  en: >-
    The lab has been established in the Graduate Institute of Photonics and
    Optoelectronics, in R404 of EE Building II.
  zhHant: 本實驗室成立於光電工程學研究所，位於電機二館 R404。
---
Prof. Yi-Teng Huang joined National Taiwan University in August 2025 and founded the
Novel Inorganic Materials Lab in the Graduate Institute of Photonics and Optoelectronics.

The lab is now recruiting master's and undergraduate students interested in semiconductor
materials, ultrafast spectroscopy and optoelectronic devices.
